What Skool vendors and why
--------------------------
Upstream ships 1,590 topics spanning ages 4-16 across 8 subjects. Skool
vendors only the age 4-10 slice (1,325 topics), with the `standards` field
dropped, plus the hard/soft prerequisite edges among Mathematics and English
topics. scripts/build_taxonomy.py regenerates that subset from a fresh clone
and is the only supported way to change these files by hand-edit.

Attribution is surfaced in-product at the foot of the parent dashboard.

Scope note: Skool is a private family app. The ODbL share-alike obligation
attaches on public distribution of a derived database — if this app is ever
published, the vendored subset and anything derived from it must ship under
ODbL with this notice intact.
